{"id": "119909", "name": "partialfrac-8", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">כתבו את&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"ltr\">\\[ \\displaystyle{{{CT:0}}}\\]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">כסכום שברים חלקיים:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"ltr\">[[input:ap]] [[validation:ap]]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"ltr\">[[feedback:partfrac]]</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">חשבו את האינטגרל</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"ltr\">\\[\\displaystyle{ \\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} =} \\] [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:Result]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Since the degree of the numerator equal to the degree of the denominator we need to use long division. \\[{{CT:0}} = {{CT:2}} + {{CT:3}}.\\] Hence, using partial fractions we have \\[{{CT:0}} = {{CT:4}}.\\] So, \\[\\begin{array}{rcl}\\displaystyle \\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle \\int {{CT:4}} d{{CT:1}} \\\\ &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle {{CT:5}} \\int {{CT:6}} d{{CT:1}} + {{CT:7}} \\int {{CT:8}} d{{CT:1}} + {{CT:9}} \\int \\left({{CT:10}}\\right) d{{CT:1}} + \\int {{CT:3}} d{{CT:1}} \\\\ &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle {{CT:11}} + {{CT:12}} + {{CT:13}}+ {{CT:14}} + c \\\\ &amp;\\displaystyle =&amp;\\displaystyle {{CT:15}}+c \\end{array}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה. יפה מאוד.</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה חלקית.</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ap", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "partfrac", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "PartFrac", "sans": "ap", "tans": "q", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "partfrac-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "partfrac-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varss:listofvars(ans1);\nvarss:delete(C,delete(c,varss));\nan1:ans1;\nfor i:1 while i<=length(varss) do an1:ev(an1,varss[i]=v);\n\nstu:ev(diff(an1,v));\nc1:ev(diff(an1,c));\nc2:ev(diff(an1,C));\nd:c1^2+c2^2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stu", "tans": "p", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"></p>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "d", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\"></p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "pp1", "pp2", "pp3", "pp4", "ppp1", "ppp2", "ppp3", "q", "rdm1", "rdm2", "